<title>USA: US cash DAP, ammonia prices mostly steady.</title>
<headline>US cash DAP, ammonia prices mostly steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash DAP and ammonia were mostly steady Monday. Fertilizer dealers said the ammonia market had a weak undertone, partly due to lower prices on the world market, but there was yet to be any business concluded at easier levels. DAP trade was very slow.</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton	  Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   177-178		    unch-dn 2</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     188			  unch</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   218-220		    unch</p>
